2017-02-08 Thore Böckelmann <tboeckel@gmx.de>

  * Window.c: removing the currently active eventhandler effectively aborted the
    eventhandler loop by stepping one node back too much. For example this
    caused the buttons in IBrowse's website source window to stay visibly
