2016-04-06 Thore Böckelmann <tboeckel@gmx.de>

  * Window.c: the previous attempt to respect the minimum dimension of a window
    border scrollbar in the window size requirements did not obey the fact that
    the window contents could be larger already an extended the requirements
    nevertheless. This resulted in an additional spacing on both sides which
    could not be removed by resizing the window. Only the amount of pixels
    exceeding the contents minimum size must be respected instead. This closes
    #302.

