    and MUI_RejectIDCMP() functions.
  * Boopsi.c: use an event handler instead of the deprecated MUI_RequestIDCMP()
    and MUI_RejectIDCMP() functions.
  * demos/Class3.c: use an event handler instead of the deprecated
    MUI_RequestIDCMP() and MUI_RejectIDCMP() functions.

2015-12-01 Thore Böckelmann <tboeckel@gmx.de>

  * misc: added Autodocs for several formerly undocumented functions (i.e.
