2015-10-26 Thore Böckelmann <tboeckel@gmx.de>

  * flushmui.c: enhanced the tool to flush single classes from memory only.

2015-10-25 Thore Böckelmann <tboeckel@gmx.de>

  * Menudisplay.c: handle the title of wrongly created menus in the same way as
    Popmenu.mui does and try to retrieve the title by MUIA_Menuitem_Title
    instead of by MUIA_Menu_Title if the latter fails. This fixes the broken
